  "description": "Ma Su-Ri, a man who is only good-looking, is suddenly kicked out of his apartment. As Su-Ri sits on the sidewalk worrying about his future, a unique otaku woman named “Kang Ji-Yu” approaches him. Ji-Yu proposes that if Su-Ri works as a housekeeper at her home and fulfills her “request,” she will not only provide meals and lodging but also pay him a massive monthly salary. \n\n*“You... you're a pervert.”*\n\nHowever, after visiting Ji-Yu's house, Su-Ri can't even last an hour and ends up packing his bags...\n\nJust how will Su-Ri's life as a housekeeper turn out?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
